✓ sulekha-smile.jpg - Smiling portrait

📝 Tips:
- Use JPG or PNG format
- High quality photos work best
- File names must match exactly (case-sensitive on Mac/Linux)
- Photos are optional - placeholders will show if missing

How to Add Photos:
1. Export your photos from your phone, cloud storage, or computer
2. Rename them to match the names above
3. Place them in this images/ folder
4. Refresh the website in your browser (Ctrl+R or Cmd+R)

That's it! Your photos will appear on the website automatically.
